// chess_board.proto — THE CHESS BOARD: a CEE CLI session's game, drawn in
// the feed as the CEE CLI webapp's own interactive widget
// (`@chesscom/cee-web-widget`), at the place in the turn where the agent asked
// for it (conversation.v1.AgentChessBoard).
//
// agent-repl ONLY RENDERS THE WIDGET. It reads no chess data: the daemon asks
// the CEE CLI's webapp backend (cee-webapp) for the widget's data, the webapp
// mounts the widget from it verbatim, and a square the reader clicks is
// answered by the daemon asking cee-webapp again and handing the answer back
// whole. Everything chess-shaped — the board, the move list, the engine's
// lines, a bad position — is the widget's to draw.
//
// LAYOUT. One bubble: a heading line, then exactly one of a progress line, an
// unavailable line, or the mounted widget.
//
//   +-FeedChessBoard--------------------------------------+
//   | [FeedChessBoardHeading: "Chess board · session x"]  |
//   | one of:                                             |
//   |   [FeedChessBoardPreparing: "Building the widget…"] |
//   |   [FeedChessBoardUnavailable: reason line]          |
//   |   +-FeedChessBoardReady----------------------------+|
//   |   | the mounted widget (board, move list, panels)  ||
//   |   +------------------------------------------------+|
//   +-----------------------------------------------------+

